## What this means in practice

You may:

- read, download, and store these documents;
- share them, in whole or in part, in any medium or format, including inside your own security
  review, procurement, or training material;
- quote them with attribution.

You must:

- credit Zafonyx Local as the source and link to this repository;
- indicate if you changed the material — though under NoDerivatives a modified copy may not be
  distributed;
- not apply legal terms or technological measures that restrict others from doing anything the
  licence permits.

You may not:

- distribute a modified, abridged, translated, or excerpted-in-isolation version of these
  documents as if it were ours.

## Scope

This licence covers the **documentation** in this repository.

It does not cover the Zafonyx Local application, its binaries, its source, its branding, or its
trade marks, all of which remain proprietary and are not licensed here. Nothing in this file
grants a licence to any patent, trade mark, or trade secret.

